{"seq":2,"slug":"diagrams-as-code","title":"架构图即代码实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/architecture-decision-records/architecture-visualization/diagrams-as-code","wordCount":1084,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"架构图即代码实践\">架构图即代码实践</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>传统的架构图绘制方式——使用 Visio、Lucidchart 或 Draw.io 等拖拽式工具——面临一个根本性问题：图表与代码之间缺乏连接，随着系统演进，文档不可避免地腐化。「架构图即代码」（Diagrams as Code）运动提出了一种根本不同的方法：用文本描述语言定义架构模型，通过渲染引擎生成可视化图表。这意味着架构图可以像代码一样被版本控制、代码评审、自动构建和持续部署。Structurizr DSL、PlantUML、D2 等工具正在让这一理念成为主流实践。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><h3 id=\"从图表到模型的范式转变\">从图表到模型的范式转变</h3><p>传统方法是「绘制图表」——关注的是视觉呈现。Diagrams as Code 的核心转变是「定义模型」——关注的是结构关系。一个模型可以生成多个视图，每个视图服务于不同的受众和目的。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[&quot;Source Code&lt;br/&gt;DSL/YAML/JSON&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;Build Engine&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;Context Diagram&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; D[&quot;Container Diagram&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; E[&quot;Dynamic Diagram&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; F[&quot;Deployment Diagram&quot;]&#10;    G[&quot;Git Repository&quot;] --&gt; A&#10;    H[&quot;CI/CD Pipeline&quot;] --&gt; B\">graph LR\n    A[\"Source Code&lt;br/&gt;DSL/YAML/JSON\"] --&gt; B[\"Build Engine\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"Context Diagram\"]\n    B --&gt; D[\"Container Diagram\"]\n    B --&gt; E[\"Dynamic Diagram\"]\n    B --&gt; F[\"Deployment Diagram\"]\n    G[\"Git Repository\"] --&gt; A\n    H[\"CI/CD Pipeline\"] --&gt; B</pre><p>这种模型驱动的方法带来了核心优势：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>单一事实来源</strong>：模型定义一次，多视图自动生成</li>\n<li><strong>版本控制</strong>：DSL 文件存储在 Git 中，每次变更都有完整历史</li>\n<li><strong>代码评审</strong>：架构变更通过 Pull Request 评审，而非邮件中的截图</li>\n<li><strong>自动化</strong>：CI/CD 管道自动渲染最新版图表，发布到文档站</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"diagrams-as-code-工具分类\">Diagrams as Code 工具分类</h3><p>当前的 Diagrams as Code 工具可分为两类：</p>\n<p><strong>图表驱动工具</strong>（Diagram-centric）：每个文件定义一张图表，语法直接描述视觉元素。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>PlantUML、Mermaid、D2、Graphviz</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>模型驱动工具</strong>（Model-centric）：定义一个底层模型（元素和关系），在此基础上定义多个视图。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Structurizr DSL、Ilograph、Carbide</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"markdown\" data-code=\"## 对比示例&#10;&#10;### 图表驱动（PlantUML）— 每张图独立定义&#10;&#10;@startuml actor User rectangle &quot;Web App&quot; as webapp database &quot;Database&quot; as db User --&gt; webapp : uses webapp --&gt; db : reads/writes @enduml&#10;&#10;### 模型驱动（Structurizr DSL）— 定义一次，多视图&#10;&#10;workspace { model { u = person &quot;User&quot; s = softwareSystem &quot;System&quot; { webapp = container &quot;Web App&quot; db = container &quot;Database&quot; } u -&gt; s.webapp &quot;Uses&quot; s.webapp -&gt; s.db &quot;Reads/writes&quot; } views { systemContext s { include _ } container s { include _ } } }\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">## 对比示例</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">### 图表驱动（PlantUML）— 每张图独立定义</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">@startuml actor User rectangle \"Web App\" as webapp database \"Database\" as db User --> webapp : uses webapp --> db : reads/writes @enduml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">### 模型驱动（Structurizr DSL）— 定义一次，多视图</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">workspace { model { u = person \"User\" s = softwareSystem \"System\" { webapp = container \"Web App\" db = container \"Database\" } u -> s.webapp \"Uses\" s.webapp -> s.db \"Reads/writes\" } views { systemContext s { include _ } container s { include _ } } }</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"实战指南\">实战指南</h2><h3 id=\"plantuml-c4-plantuml-实践\">PlantUML + C4-PlantUML 实践</h3><p>PlantUML 通过 C4-PlantUML 扩展库支持 C4 模型语法。这是最广泛使用的免费开源方案：</p>\n<pre class=\"plantuml-chart\" data-chart-type=\"plantuml\">@startuml\n!include &lt;C4/C4_Context&gt;\n!include &lt;C4/C4_Container&gt;\n\ntitle System Context - E-Commerce Platform\n\nPerson(customer, \"Customer\", \"Browses and buys products\")\nPerson(admin, \"Admin\", \"Manages catalog and orders\")\n\nSystem(ecommerce, \"E-Commerce Platform\", \"Allows customers to browse and purchase products\")\n\nSystem_Ext(payment, \"Payment Gateway\", \"Processes payments via Stripe\")\nSystem_Ext(shipping, \"Shipping Service\", \"Handles logistics via FedEx API\")\nSystem_Ext(email, \"Email Service\", \"Sends transactional emails via SendGrid\")\n\nRel(customer, ecommerce, \"Browses catalog, places orders\", \"HTTPS\")\nRel(admin, ecommerce, \"Manages products, processes returns\", \"HTTPS\")\nRel(ecommerce, payment, \"Processes payments\", \"HTTPS/API\")\nRel(ecommerce, shipping, \"Creates shipments\", \"HTTPS/API\")\nRel(ecommerce, email, \"Sends notifications\", \"SMTP/API\")\n\n@enduml</pre><p>Container 层级的 PlantUML 示例：</p>\n<pre class=\"plantuml-chart\" data-chart-type=\"plantuml\">@startuml\n!include &lt;C4/C4_Container&gt;\n\ntitle Container Diagram - E-Commerce Platform\n\nPerson(customer, \"Customer\", \"Online shopper\")\n\nSystem_Boundary(ecommerce, \"E-Commerce Platform\") {\n    Container(spa, \"SPA Frontend\", \"React, TypeScript\", \"Product browsing and checkout UI\")\n    Container(api, \"API Server\", \"Node.js, Express\", \"Business logic and API endpoints\")\n    Container(worker, \"Background Worker\", \"Node.js, Bull\", \"Async tasks: emails, reports\")\n    ContainerDb(db, \"Database\", \"PostgreSQL 16\", \"Products, orders, users\")\n    ContainerDb(cache, \"Cache\", \"Redis\", \"Session, product cache\")\n    Container(search, \"Search Engine\", \"Elasticsearch\", \"Full-text product search\")\n}\n\nSystem_Ext(stripe, \"Stripe\", \"Payment processing\")\n\nRel(customer, spa, \"Uses\", \"HTTPS\")\nRel(spa, api, \"API calls\", \"JSON/HTTPS\")\nRel(api, db, \"Reads/writes\", \"SQL/TLS\")\nRel(api, cache, \"Caches\", \"Redis Protocol\")\nRel(api, search, \"Queries\", \"HTTP\")\nRel(api, worker, \"Enqueues jobs\", \"Redis/Bull\")\nRel(worker, stripe, \"Processes payments\", \"HTTPS\")\n\n@enduml</pre><h3 id=\"d2-语言实践\">D2 语言实践</h3><p>D2 是 2023 年后兴起的新一代图表语言，语法更加直观且支持主题化：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"d2\" data-code=\"direction: right&#10;&#10;customer: Customer {&#10;  shape: person&#10;}&#10;&#10;ecommerce: E-Commerce Platform {&#10;  style.stroke: &quot;#0077b6&quot;&#10;&#10;  frontend: React SPA {&#10;    shape: rectangle&#10;    style.fill: &quot;#caf0f8&quot;&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  api: API Server (Node.js) {&#10;    shape: rectangle&#10;    style.fill: &quot;#90e0ef&quot;&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  db: PostgreSQL {&#10;    shape: cylinder&#10;    style.fill: &quot;#0096c7&quot;&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  redis: Redis Cache {&#10;    shape: cylinder&#10;    style.fill: &quot;#ff6b6b&quot;&#10;  }&#10;}&#10;&#10;stripe: Stripe Payment {&#10;  shape: rectangle&#10;  style.stroke-dash: 3&#10;}&#10;&#10;customer -&gt; ecommerce.frontend: HTTPS&#10;ecommerce.frontend -&gt; ecommerce.api: REST/JSON&#10;ecommerce.api -&gt; ecommerce.db: SQL&#10;ecommerce.api -&gt; ecommerce.redis: Cache&#10;ecommerce.api -&gt; stripe: Payment API\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>direction: right</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>customer: Customer {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  shape: person</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>ecommerce: E-Commerce Platform {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  style.stroke: \"#0077b6\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  frontend: React SPA {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    shape: rectangle</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    style.fill: \"#caf0f8\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  api: API Server (Node.js) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    shape: rectangle</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    style.fill: \"#90e0ef\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  db: PostgreSQL {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    shape: cylinder</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    style.fill: \"#0096c7\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  redis: Redis Cache {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    shape: cylinder</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    style.fill: \"#ff6b6b\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>stripe: Stripe Payment {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  shape: rectangle</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  style.stroke-dash: 3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>customer -> ecommerce.frontend: HTTPS</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>ecommerce.frontend -> ecommerce.api: REST/JSON</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>ecommerce.api -> ecommerce.db: SQL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>ecommerce.api -> ecommerce.redis: Cache</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>ecommerce.api -> stripe: Payment API</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"ci-cd-集成-自动生成和发布架构图\">CI/CD 集成：自动生成和发布架构图</h3><p>将架构图的渲染集成到 CI/CD 流水线中，确保文档站始终展示最新版本：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# .github/workflows/architecture-docs.yml&#10;name: Build Architecture Diagrams&#10;on:&#10;  push:&#10;    paths:&#10;      - &#39;docs/architecture/**&#39;&#10;      - &#39;.structurizr/**&#39;&#10;&#10;jobs:&#10;  render-diagrams:&#10;    runs-on: ubuntu-latest&#10;    steps:&#10;      - uses: actions/checkout@v4&#10;&#10;      - name: Render Structurizr DSL&#10;        uses: docker://structurizr/cli:latest&#10;        with:&#10;          args: export -workspace .structurizr/workspace.dsl -format plantuml/c4plantuml -output docs/diagrams/&#10;&#10;      - name: Render PlantUML to SVG&#10;        uses: docker://plantuml/plantuml-server:latest&#10;        run: |&#10;          for f in docs/diagrams/*.puml; do&#10;            java -jar /opt/plantuml.jar -tsvg &quot;$f&quot;&#10;          done&#10;&#10;      - name: Render Mermaid diagrams&#10;        uses: docker://minlag/mermaid-cli:latest&#10;        with:&#10;          args: -i docs/architecture/ -o docs/rendered/ -e svg&#10;&#10;      - name: Deploy to docs site&#10;        uses: peaceiris/actions-gh-pages@v4&#10;        with:&#10;          publish_dir: ./docs/rendered\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># .github/workflows/architecture-docs.yml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Build Architecture Diagrams</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  push</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    paths</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'docs/architecture/**'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'.structurizr/**'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">jobs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  render-diagrams</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    runs-on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ubuntu-latest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    steps</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">actions/checkout@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Render Structurizr DSL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">docker://structurizr/cli:latest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          args</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">export -workspace .structurizr/workspace.dsl -format plantuml/c4plantuml -output docs/diagrams/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Render PlantUML to SVG</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">docker://plantuml/plantuml-server:latest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          for f in docs/diagrams/*.puml; do</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            java -jar /opt/plantuml.jar -tsvg \"$f\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          done</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Render Mermaid diagrams</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">docker://minlag/mermaid-cli:latest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          args</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-i docs/architecture/ -o docs/rendered/ -e svg</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Deploy to docs site</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">peaceiris/actions-gh-pages@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          publish_dir</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">./docs/rendered</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"git-工作流与图表变更评审\">Git 工作流与图表变更评审</h3><p>架构图作为代码意味着变更必须经过评审：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 创建架构变更分支&#10;git checkout -b arch/add-notification-service&#10;&#10;# 修改 Structurizr DSL&#10;vim .structurizr/workspace.dsl&#10;&#10;# 本地预览变更&#10;docker run -it --rm -p 8080:8080 \\&#10;  -v $(pwd)/.structurizr:/usr/local/structurizr \\&#10;  structurizr/lite&#10;&#10;# 提交并创建 PR&#10;git add .structurizr/&#10;git commit -m &quot;docs(arch): add notification service to container diagram&quot;&#10;git push origin arch/add-notification-service\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 创建架构变更分支</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> checkout</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -b</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> arch/add-notification-service</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 修改 Structurizr DSL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">vim</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> .structurizr/workspace.dsl</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 本地预览变更</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">docker</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> run</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -it</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --rm</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -p</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 8080:8080</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  -v</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">pwd</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/.structurizr:/usr/local/structurizr</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  structurizr/lite</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 提交并创建 PR</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> add</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> .structurizr/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> commit</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -m</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"docs(arch): add notification service to container diagram\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> push</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> origin</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> arch/add-notification-service</span></span></code></pre></div><p>PR 中的架构变更 diff 清晰可读：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"diff\" data-code=\"  model {&#10;      u = person &quot;User&quot;&#10;      s = softwareSystem &quot;Platform&quot; {&#10;          api = container &quot;API Server&quot;&#10;          db = container &quot;Database&quot;&#10;+         notifier = container &quot;Notification Service&quot; &quot;Sends push/email/SMS&quot;&#10;+         queue = container &quot;Message Queue&quot; &quot;RabbitMQ&quot;&#10;      }&#10;      u -&gt; s.api &quot;Uses&quot;&#10;      s.api -&gt; s.db &quot;Reads/writes&quot;&#10;+     s.api -&gt; s.queue &quot;Publishes events&quot;&#10;+     s.queue -&gt; s.notifier &quot;Delivers notifications&quot;&#10;  }\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>  model {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      u = person \"User\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      s = softwareSystem \"Platform\" {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          api = container \"API Server\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          db = container \"Database\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>+         notifier = container \"Notification Service\" \"Sends push/email/SMS\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>+         queue = container \"Message Queue\" \"RabbitMQ\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      u -> s.api \"Uses\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      s.api -> s.db \"Reads/writes\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>+     s.api -> s.queue \"Publishes events\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>+     s.queue -> s.notifier \"Delivers notifications\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"最佳实践\">最佳实践</h2><h3 id=\"文件组织结构\">文件组织结构</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"project-root/&#10;├── .structurizr/&#10;│   ├── workspace.dsl          # 主模型定义&#10;│   ├── views.dsl              # 视图配置（可从主文件 include）&#10;│   └── styles.dsl             # 样式定义&#10;├── docs/&#10;│   ├── architecture/&#10;│   │   ├── diagrams/          # 渲染输出（.svg/.png，gitignore）&#10;│   │   ├── adr/               # ADR 文件&#10;│   │   └── README.md          # 架构概览，引用图表&#10;│   └── ...&#10;├── .github/&#10;│   └── workflows/&#10;│       └── architecture.yml   # 自动渲染流水线&#10;└── .gitignore                 # 忽略 docs/architecture/diagrams/\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>project-root/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── .structurizr/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── workspace.dsl          # 主模型定义</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── views.dsl              # 视图配置（可从主文件 include）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   └── styles.dsl             # 样式定义</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── docs/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── architecture/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   ├── diagrams/          # 渲染输出（.svg/.png，gitignore）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   ├── adr/               # ADR 文件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   └── README.md          # 架构概览，引用图表</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   └── ...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── .github/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   └── workflows/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│       └── architecture.yml   # 自动渲染流水线</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>└── .gitignore                 # 忽略 docs/architecture/diagrams/</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"模型与图表的版本策略\">模型与图表的版本策略</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>实现方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>源码+输出均入库</td>\n<td>需要离线查看、无 CI/CD</td>\n<td>手动渲染后 commit</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>仅源码入库</td>\n<td>有 CI/CD 环境</td>\n<td>输出目录加入 .gitignore</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>模型标签化</td>\n<td>需要对比不同版本</td>\n<td>git tag 标记关键架构里程碑</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分支策略</td>\n<td>架构提案评审</td>\n<td>在特性分支中修改模型</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"避免的常见陷阱\">避免的常见陷阱</h3><p><strong>陷阱一：过度建模</strong>。不需要为每一个微服务都创建完整的四层 C4。聚焦于核心系统和变化频繁的区域。</p>\n<p><strong>陷阱二：忽略渲染一致性</strong>。不同版本的渲染工具可能产生不同的布局。在 CI 中固定工具版本号。</p>\n<p><strong>陷阱三：模型与代码脱节</strong>。设置定期检查机制，确保 DSL 中定义的服务和容器仍然反映实际系统。</p>\n<h2 id=\"工具与生态\">工具与生态</h2><h3 id=\"工具选型对比\">工具选型对比</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>工具</th>\n<th>语言</th>\n<th>学习曲线</th>\n<th>布局控制</th>\n<th>Git 友好度</th>\n<th>C4 支持</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Structurizr DSL</td>\n<td>专用 DSL</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>自动+手动</td>\n<td>⭐⭐⭐</td>\n<td>原生</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PlantUML</td>\n<td>文本标记</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>有限</td>\n<td>⭐⭐⭐</td>\n<td>扩展库</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mermaid</td>\n<td>文本标记</td>\n<td>极低</td>\n<td>自动</td>\n<td>⭐⭐⭐</td>\n<td>有限</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>D2</td>\n<td>文本标记</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>良好</td>\n<td>⭐⭐⭐</td>\n<td>手动</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Graphviz/DOT</td>\n<td>DOT 语言</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>算法</td>\n<td>⭐⭐⭐</td>\n<td>无</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Diagrams (Python)</td>\n<td>Python</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>有限</td>\n<td>⭐⭐</td>\n<td>无</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"编辑器支持\">编辑器支持</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>VS Code</strong>：PlantUML 插件（实时预览）、Mermaid Preview、D2 Language</li>\n<li><strong>IntelliJ</strong>：PlantUML integration（内置渲染）</li>\n<li><strong>Vim/Neovim</strong>：plantuml-previewer、mermaid.vim</li>\n<li><strong>Web</strong>：Structurizr Lite（Docker 本地运行）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"总结\">总结</h2><p>架构图即代码将架构文档从静态的、容易过时的 PNG 文件转变为活的、可演进的代码资产。选择合适的工具时考虑三个维度：团队技术栈兼容性（是否已经使用 PlantUML/Mermaid）、模型复杂度（单图还是多视图）、以及协作需求（是否需要非开发者参与）。从最轻量的 Mermaid 或 PlantUML 开始，在需要时升级到 Structurizr DSL 的完整模型驱动方案。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"架构图即代码实践","id":"架构图即代码实践"},{"level":2,"text":"概述","id":"概述"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":3,"text":"从图表到模型的范式转变","id":"从图表到模型的范式转变"},{"level":3,"text":"Diagrams as Code 工具分类","id":"diagrams-as-code-工具分类"},{"level":2,"text":"实战指南","id":"实战指南"},{"level":3,"text":"PlantUML + C4-PlantUML 实践","id":"plantuml-c4-plantuml-实践"},{"level":3,"text":"D2 语言实践","id":"d2-语言实践"},{"level":3,"text":"CI/CD 集成：自动生成和发布架构图","id":"ci-cd-集成-自动生成和发布架构图"},{"level":3,"text":"Git 工作流与图表变更评审","id":"git-工作流与图表变更评审"},{"level":2,"text":"最佳实践","id":"最佳实践"},{"level":3,"text":"文件组织结构","id":"文件组织结构"},{"level":3,"text":"模型与图表的版本策略","id":"模型与图表的版本策略"},{"level":3,"text":"避免的常见陷阱","id":"避免的常见陷阱"},{"level":2,"text":"工具与生态","id":"工具与生态"},{"level":3,"text":"工具选型对比","id":"工具选型对比"},{"level":3,"text":"编辑器支持","id":"编辑器支持"},{"level":2,"text":"总结","id":"总结"}],"prev":{"title":"C4 模型深度解析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/architecture-decision-records/architecture-visualization/c4-model-deep-dive"},"next":{"title":"Mermaid 与团队协作图表","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/architecture-decision-records/architecture-visualization/mermaid-collaboration"}}